Relevant columns and their potential usage for analyzing push‑notification engagement between 08:00 and 09:00 (UTC) on 2023‑06‑01  

• "TIME": epoch‑seconds event timestamp ‑‑ filter to 1‑hour window ( 1685635200 ≤ TIME < 1685638800 ).  
• "USER_ID": join key & unique‑user counting.  
• "EXTERNAL_USER_ID": alternate user identifier.  
• "APP_GROUP_ID" / "APP_ID": app segmentation.  
• "CAMPAIGN_ID" / "CAMPAIGN_API_ID": campaign‑level grouping.  
• "MESSAGE_VARIATION_ID" / "MESSAGE_VARIATION_API_ID": creative‑level grouping.  
• "PLATFORM": iOS / Android split.  
• "AD_TRACKING_ENABLED": privacy segmentation.  
• "DEVICE_MODEL", "OS_VERSION", "SDK_VERSION": device analytics.  
• "COUNTRY", "TIMEZONE", "LANGUAGE": geo‑locale analysis.  
• "SEND_ID" / "DISPATCH_ID": event correlation across views.  
• "BOOLEAN_CUSTOM_ATTRIBUTES", "STRING_CUSTOM_ATTRIBUTES", …: optional deep dive (flatten as needed).  

